            "rationale": "The change adds no Tier 1/2 code. The 'refuse to overwrite an existing backup' decision is made in the Tier 3 use case `backup`. `backupInfo` aggregates the total owed across all members in Tier 3. Each member's owed amount does come from Tier 2 `Accounts.owed`, and `restore` has no lending rule. These are thin application and persistence-policy rules, not lending-legality rules. They are still decided outside Tier 2, so I scored 1 rather than 2.",
