            ],
            "rationale": "The summary is defined once in `Views.summarize` and the CLI formatting is defined once in `showSummary`. The 'no backup' error is defined once in `noBackup`. The owed amount reuses `Accounts.owed` and `Views.money`, so no domain fact is restated.",
