            "rationale": "The new rules are the refusal when the backup lacks the member, the refusal when the member already exists, and the choice of what to restore (fines and payments only, not loans, holds or reminders). All of them are in the Tier 2 transition `Catalog.restoreMember`. The use case only loads the backup, calls Tier 2 and builds a view. The CLI only parses and renders.",
